[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Security[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Firestore Rules**: Per-document `churchId` matching + auth checks[m
[32m+[m[32m- **API Routes**: Rate-limiting-ready, role-based middleware[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Headers**: X-Frame-Options, X-Content-Type-Options, Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy enforced via Next.js config[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Admin SDK**: Server-only initialization, private key stored in env vars[m
[32m+[m
